  "prompt_mode": "short_sentence_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nYour entire life, you've been told you're deathly allergic to bees. You've always had people protecting you from them, be it your mother or a hired hand. Today, one slips through and lands on your shoulder. You hear a tiny voice say \"Your Majesty, what are your orders?\" You look around in confusion, and then in panic, when you spot the bee. You raise your hand cautiously to try to swat it, or  brush it off.\n\nThe bee speaks. \"No, Your Majesty, do not strike. I am your loyal servant, and I will not harm you.\" You wonder if you've already been stung, and this is some strange, venom-induced, hallucination. You try to recover your composure, and ask the obvious question. \"How can you speak?\" The bee responds. \"I have been given the gift of speech by the Queen of the Bees, and I have been sent to you to help you.\" \"Help me do what? Why did you call me 'Your Majesty?' you ask. \"Your mother, the Queen of the Bees is dying, and you are the Princess of Bees, her heir. She has sent me to help you become the new Queen of the Bees.\"\n\n\"How is any of this possible?\" you ask. \"My mother is human, and I am human.\" You pause.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 8,
